<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish Life appoints new finance director.</title>
<headline>Irish Life appoints new finance director.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish Life Plc said on Thursday it had appointed Stephen Shone as Group Chief Financial Officer, with immediate effect.</p>
<p>Shone replaces Peter Fullam, who has been appointed Development Director, Irish Life said in a statement.  </p>
<p>&quot;Peter's appointment arises from the company's desire to accelerate a number of specific projects within the group,&quot; Irish Life said. &quot;These are currently in the area of the IFSC operation (Irish Life International), Xaar in France and in the United States.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 660 3377</p>
